179 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 44 0 R
/E (Your Head of Talent has led the Learning and Development function for three years. You have become accustomed to her leadership style. She gives you space to work independently, trusts you to solve problems and supports you publicly, even when she challenges you privately.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
180 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 44 0 R
